WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.199
Henry pushed his way through the hedge as quietly as he could.

2
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.907
Nora was halfway across the backyard by now.

3
00:00:09.908 --> 00:00:12.885
"Shh!" he warned the others.

4
00:00:12.886 --> 00:00:16.669
"Don't make too much noise, or she'll know we're here.

5
00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:18.818
And try to stay hidden!"

6
00:00:18.819 --> 00:00:23.796
He realized that it wasn't going to be easy to follow Nora without being spotted.

7
00:00:23.797 --> 00:00:26.747
They would have to be very careful.

8
00:00:26.748 --> 00:00:30.813
Luckily, there were plenty of tall shrubs in the backyard.

9
00:00:30.814 --> 00:00:34.817
Henry rushed out and ducked behind the closest one.

10
00:00:34.818 --> 00:00:37.961
A second later Cole joined him behind the shrub.

11
00:00:37.962 --> 00:00:40.878
Maggie and Nathan were right behind him.

12
00:00:40.879 --> 00:00:44.751
"Where's she going?" Cole whispered in Henry's ear.

13
00:00:44.752 --> 00:00:49.666
Henry peeked at Nora. She hadn't heard or seen them yet.

14
00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:53.221
But she sure didn't look as if she were sleepwalking.

15
00:00:53.222 --> 00:00:56.458
She stopped every few steps to look around.

16
00:00:56.459 --> 00:01:04.603
"I can't tell for sure, but it looks like she's heading toward the woods at the back of the yard," Henry whispered back.

17
00:01:04.604 --> 00:01:10.740
"Come on, let's try to get closer. We don't want to lose sight of her if she goes into the woods."

18
00:01:10.741 --> 00:01:14.154
They all dashed across the yard to another shrub.

19
00:01:14.155 --> 00:01:18.377
When they were safely hidden behind it, Henry peeked out again.

20
00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:24.836
Nora had stopped and turned around. She had a suspicious look on her face.

21
00:01:24.837 --> 00:01:28.740
Henry yanked his head back behind the shrub.

22
00:01:28.741 --> 00:01:31.476
Whew! Nora hadn't spotted him.

23
00:01:31.477 --> 00:01:35.491
He put a finger to his lips to warn the others to be quiet.

24
00:01:35.492 --> 00:01:41.103
They waited silently for a few seconds. Then Maggie peeked out.

25
00:01:41.104 --> 00:01:46.987
Her eyes widened. "Hey," she said, sounding excited.

26
00:01:46.988 --> 00:01:50.990
"It looks like she might be heading for Nathan's tree house!"

27
00:01:50.991 --> 00:01:56.492
Henry winced. In her excitement Maggie had forgotten to whisper.

28
00:01:56.493 --> 00:01:59.223
And her voice was always pretty loud.

29
00:01:59.224 --> 00:02:02.789
A second later he heard the sound of running feet.

30
00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:07.436
When he jumped out from behind the shrub, he saw Nora running away.

31
00:02:07.437 --> 00:02:13.115
"She heard us," he called to his friends. "Come on, let's catch her!"

32
00:02:13.116 --> 00:02:18.343
"Nora!" Nathan yelled as they all started running. "Stop!"

33
00:02:18.344 --> 00:02:23.735
But Nora didn't stop. That was no surprise, at least to Henry.

34
00:02:23.736 --> 00:02:29.509
As far as he could tell, Nora hardly ever did anything anyone told her to do!

35
00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:32.960
Nora was a pretty fast runner for a little kid.

36
00:02:32.961 --> 00:02:36.670
She raced across the yard and disappeared through the hedge.

37
00:02:36.671 --> 00:02:42.084
"She's in the neighbors' yard," Maggie said. "Hurry!"

38
00:02:42.085 --> 00:02:45.363
Henry ran as fast as he could toward the hedge.

39
00:02:45.364 --> 00:02:49.190
It was too thick to see anything on the other side.

40
00:02:49.191 --> 00:02:53.235
But he kept his eyes on the spot where Nora had pushed through.

41
00:02:53.236 --> 00:02:57.498
Cole was the fastest of all of them, so he got there first.

42
00:02:57.499 --> 00:03:02.028
"Ahh!" he yelled as he pushed through the hedge.

43
00:03:02.029 --> 00:03:05.975
"Hey, where'd she go?" he called from the other side.

44
00:03:05.976 --> 00:03:09.046
Henry pushed through the hedge too.

45
00:03:09.047 --> 00:03:12.156
He looked around and saw Cole standing there.

46
00:03:12.157 --> 00:03:15.114
A second later Maggie and Nathan appeared.

47
00:03:15.115 --> 00:03:17.887
But there was no sign of Nora.

48
00:03:17.888 --> 00:03:22.053
"Uh-oh," Cole said. "Do you think she's hiding?"

49
00:03:22.054 --> 00:03:27.746
Nathan was out of breath after all the running, so it took him a second to answer.

50
00:03:27.747 --> 00:03:32.448
"Probably," he said. "She likes to hide.

51
00:03:32.449 --> 00:03:37.952
Once she hid in the basement and my parents couldn't find her for over an hour."

52
00:03:37.953 --> 00:03:40.535
Henry looked around the neighbors' yard.

53
00:03:40.536 --> 00:03:45.455
It was smaller than Nathan and Nora's yard, but there were plenty of places to hide.

54
00:03:45.456 --> 00:03:53.783
There was a large vegetable garden with lots of big tomato plants, a patch of corn, and teepees covered with bean vines.

55
00:03:53.784 --> 00:03:59.997
The rest of the yard had shrubs and flowers, a birdbath, and a sculpture of a dog.

56
00:03:59.998 --> 00:04:05.292
At the back of the yard was the same forest that ran behind all the houses on the block.

57
00:04:05.293 --> 00:04:09.646
"Let's spread out and search for her," Henry decided.

58
00:04:09.647 --> 00:04:13.870
"Nathan, you go that way and search the neighbors' flower beds.

59
00:04:13.871 --> 00:04:17.792
Maggie, check the front yard and the other side of the house.

60
00:04:17.793 --> 00:04:21.637
Cole, make sure she's not hiding out in the woods.

61
00:04:21.638 --> 00:04:23.993
I'll check the vegetable garden."

62
00:04:23.994 --> 00:04:30.322
"Okay," Nathan said, and the others nodded. Then they split up.

63
00:04:30.323 --> 00:04:33.450
Henry hurried over to the vegetable garden.

64
00:04:33.451 --> 00:04:38.483
He peeked behind every tomato plant and bean teepee.

65
00:04:38.484 --> 00:04:45.044
He looked into the corn patch. He even checked under the wheelbarrow.

66
00:04:45.045 --> 00:04:47.829
But there was no sign of Nora.

67
00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:52.347
By the time he finished searching, his friends were coming back.

68
00:04:52.348 --> 00:04:56.018
"I didn't see her," Maggie reported.

69
00:04:56.019 --> 00:05:00.494
"Me neither," Cole said. "What about you, Nathan?"

70
00:05:00.495 --> 00:05:05.343
"Nope," Nathan said. "Did you find anything, Henry?"

71
00:05:05.344 --> 00:05:14.148
Henry shook his head and sighed. "It looks like Nora got away from us."

